{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_forge","model_identifier":"dwarf_forge","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_forge\n\nDwarf forge: a stone forge-house with an iron chimney stack, a glowing hearth seen through a wide arch, an anvil out front and bellows that pump (`working`).\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 7 columns (128 x 112 units, 3.60 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -54..50, y 0..176, z -56..42 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 23, construction_0 17, construction_33 37, construction_66 40, ruined 17 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 96 x 176 x 72 centred at x 0, z 4\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `dwarf_forge_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `dwarf_forge_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_dwarf_forge` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 1.6 | loop | `bellows` bellows pump. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 16, -36)\n- `fx_smoke` at (28, 178, 18)\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -44)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, -64)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"f_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-50.0,0.0,-34.0],"to":[50.0,4.0,42.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,304.0,100.0,308.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[96.0,308.0,172.0,312.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,304.0,100.0,308.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[96.0,308.0,172.0,312.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,186.0,100.0,262.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,186.0,100.0,262.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"42377952-5ca6-5d0d-83c8-83bfbf6fbb81"},{"name":"f_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.0,4.0,-32.0],"to":[48.0,84.0,-28.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[48.0,0.0,144.0,80.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[208.0,0.0,212.0,80.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[48.0,0.0,144.0,80.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[208.0,0.0,212.0,80.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[100.0,304.0,196.0,308.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[100.0,304.0,196.0,308.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"791d7114-ac83-5da5-a131-c0da597afef1"},{"name":"f_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.0,4.0,36.0],"to":[48.0,84.0,40.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[48.0,0.0,144.0,80.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[212.0,0.0,216.0,80.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[48.0,0.0,144.0,80.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[212.0,0.0,216.0,80.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,308.0,96.0,312.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,308.0,96.0,